  "rawHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;background:#f3eada;padding:6px 0;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:#2a1d10;margin:0;\">\n    所谓\"江湖夜雨十年灯\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;color:#6b4a2a;padding:0 6px;margin:0 3px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #6b4a2a;border-bottom:1px solid #6b4a2a;\">黄庭坚《寄黄几复》<br>之颔联也</span>者，<span style=\"color:#a03a2a;\">编者每读至此，</span>辄思故人。\n  </p>\n</div>"
